{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bec11b12cfb6ec8a3b09579fe3ef99ec677990d34af4282bbbc52af00ae07e79", "ja": "（今日は、静香の宣材写真撮影だ。\nえーっと……静香は、どこにいるのかな？）", "zh": "（今天要拍静香的宣传照。\n呃……静香跑去哪了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "57bbe6c9091660b6b6d3157f97e7569f2b0e6a7d6335affcf8e67005c24ce778", "ja": "あっ、静香。", "zh": "啊，静香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "8d1d8fd9b5ae7f3e5a58251fd8e46b21c5debfbb9f997ec31bd6d9d211fc3fe4", "ja": "どうしたんですか、キョロキョロして。\nみっともないですよ。", "zh": "怎么了吗？看你到处东张西望的，\n很不稳重耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e3747eec2a3473ecbbd2560ce7850035b56e954d1fd87c1ab205375237b15575", "ja": "すまない……というか、静香を探してたんだ。\nどこにいたんだ？", "zh": "抱歉……其实我是在找静香你啦。\n你刚才去哪了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "135c0c534e0a9a693a4da9a99344f9e7ecceb624d05499de505c74f5fd1c9eba", "ja": "スタッフの方達に、挨拶してきたんです。\n早めに入って挨拶するのは、新人の常識でしょう？", "zh": "我刚才去向工作人员打招呼。\n提早来打招呼，是身为新人的基本常识对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e3f6998b54721a7a0ab4245e5dd27068a32e7144b7d41b1a4a1da8185839d7f0", "ja": "なんだ、そうだったのか。\n静香はしっかりしてるんだな。", "zh": "什么嘛，原来是这样啊。\n静香个性很严谨呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1008_p", "source_sha256": "dbcb67aa441557cb1cc78a8f54b5e9ac84d90f5c80ee8134bf62f11c6bcb6165", "ja": "今日がアイドルとしての初仕事だけど、\n緊張してないか？", "zh": "今天是你当上偶像后的第一件工作，\n你会紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d3a72e6b26b8e799494de5a477705dfb5ad94eb6e5d9b74d5d187141ee035be2", "ja": "不安なことがあったら、何でも聞いてくれ。", "zh": "如果有什么不安，尽管告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "044f2a0f24e337cca16760bbb78205c8c20df8f48eb439df0b60bc7a5cb8f3fc", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。\n私をあまり子ども扱いしないでください。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}，\n请别把我当小孩子看待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "cb93d6827368bb8e4af5322fdc9cc4ee256e8e888cb47a758ac72982b4e048ff", "ja": "撮影のことはしっかり勉強してきましたから、\n何の問題もありません。", "zh": "我有好好学过怎么拍摄，\n所以没有任何问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "764c213c4c0d290d7d51aea2eb06bad7f17fe019f787c13f583b9d12345ee45a", "ja": "ちゃんとひとりで、挨拶も済ませました。\n撮影だって、きっとイメージ通りにできるはずです。", "zh": "而且也自己去打过招呼了，\n我想拍摄肯定会跟想像中一样顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e9e72d228cb94fb59d0db4352e96718fefecd719c76d3352cd960e7c97a2ba80", "ja": "（そうは言ってるけど、やっぱり表情が少し硬いな）", "zh": "（虽然她嘴上这样说，但表情还是有点僵硬呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "f281261b862b0abc707a02e7fcd74ca3fabf802ec2e4d1d5eed2748fda5b4a54", "ja": "な、なんですか？\n人の顔をじっと見たりして……。", "zh": "怎、怎么了吗？\n为什么一直盯我的脸看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "3c2b3fc95349cc6a11d4a07203b8725d7e38a144745e979ce621244dc3984692", "ja": "あっ！\nもしかして、メイクが崩れてるとか……！？", "zh": "啊！\n该不会脱妆了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9acba2f9353fbb388d16bd1da8e23473475959a5028ca7cd01e01a6c0bcf5b59", "ja": "いや、そんなことないよ。\nかわいいと思う。", "zh": "不是啦，没有脱妆。\n我是觉得你这样很可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "aefd1bbbadba59b8ec36cdcdf948d55dae1a91db0d457758aff551071b95c5b1", "ja": "そっ……そう、ですか。\n……。", "zh": "是……是吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1018_p", "source_sha256": "87a03d5068afb0a5754e287af837cfac58ce83f50335d047f3f3047807aef3e7", "ja": "そうだな……。静香はしっかりしてるし、\n俺のアドバイスなんか必要なかったかもしれない。", "zh": "我想想……静香个性很严谨，\n可能不需要我的建议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a32884da49dc3c2fb2a64f289ed0f46e9db5473e52fd0807b35a1585189713e1", "ja": "ありのままの静香を見せればいいんだ。\n事務所の先輩達だってそうしてるんだし、うん。", "zh": "只要展现出静香最自在的样子就好了。\n事务所的前辈们也是如此，嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "008717a87e399e502fd2d83fbc6480ca96f5f4fd38e79f8d8e8f4569cf2b7b4a", "ja": "！\nそれって……春香さんや、千早さんもですか。", "zh": "！\n你是说……春香和千早她们也是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a2518691cffbcc233f8c9763cec9b2f2ba5dda689dc71c4d861cbadd650d8c3d", "ja": "ああ。だから、何も遠慮することない。\n最上静香は、トップアイドルを目指してるんだからな！", "zh": "是呀，所以你不必有所顾虑。\n毕竟最上静香是以顶尖偶像为目标嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "24506d11ca5caa5eabb145ad27a9e3557e926f6a8c557e5d09bdb1b38d075076", "ja": "も、もちろんそのつもりです。\n……。", "zh": "我、我当然是这么打算的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "0924d278daf5a28c5a820578e2855f319107cdf6ff7b151ec858f92fce8e3946", "ja": "{$P$}の意見、少しですけど\n参考になりました。あ……ありがとうございます。", "zh": "{$P$}的意见，\n是有一点参考价值。谢……谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1025_null", "source_sha256": "a8ba5f63568d1a2ab1f0cbe6fd89097aadb0c318b65cba044ff7567676625767", "ja": "その後……", "zh": "在那之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1026_p", "source_sha256": "e3dcf59b0a72658b6e4d2a19963e40dbd92ee3615f65b5b580e94ab344305f3e", "ja": "（静香はまっすぐにカメラと向き合い、\n宣材写真の撮影を終わらせた）", "zh": "（静香坦率地面对镜头，\n结束了宣传照的拍摄。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1027_p", "source_sha256": "f49c9a0cd7089189861ec4f82d58e3323111a692ae12c4d57282dd84a552816e", "ja": "静香、さすがだな！\nいい写真が撮れたって、カメラマンさんもほめてたぞ。", "zh": "不愧是静香！\n摄影师也说有拍到好照片，夸了你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "6c2396767c8d7a1efad35fa30cb902de13f3935b378bdc565a4ad1c070e61133", "ja": "このくらい、ひとりでできて当然です。\nさっきも言いましたけど子ども扱いしないでください。", "zh": "这点小事，独自完成也是应该的。\n刚才我也说过了，请别把我当小孩子看待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1029_p", "source_sha256": "1aa0d276dda84b06599a5d1a465583d300fc085b95004ec2cf2ed5b4b2d5dc12", "ja": "うん、そうだったな。\nこれから気をつけるよ。", "zh": "嗯，也是。\n我之后会注意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "837b36a5ce7061ad8d4c851cd8e754fa76ca7f4371165c969f7be23db77d8549", "ja": "これからも私、自分のことは自分でやりますから。", "zh": "以后我也会独力完成份内工作的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "f94df6bebea696eb43b555b07a72f869d3a42d48a3960eab6ff6cad7db1f0def", "ja": "{$P$}は、宣伝や自分のお仕事に\n専念してください。よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "{$P$}就专注在宣传跟\n自己的工作吧，还请多多指教。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1032_p", "source_sha256": "380732e4aa2ef83b567d6bafbf7d545a531b87f4e47dc7467ab9a3446e43c41e", "ja": "（まだ、完璧には信用されてないみたいだ……）", "zh": "（她好像还没完全信任我……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_002_1033_p", "source_sha256": "0dfca11ba8783cfa8d1f42e4248933d0f2ebebb007ba6cb795d1c747c444f514", "ja": "（なら……まずは静香が、安心してアイドル活動に\n専念できるようにしなきゃな）", "zh": "（既然如此……我得先让静香能安心\n专注投入偶像活动才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
